          "caption": "Buried in Gora Qabaristan Karachi, wife of Jean Louis Rieu, Chief Commissioner in Sind from 1920 - 1925. From 1847 to 1936, Sind was part of Bombay Presidency and The Commissioner in Sind was the most important government official in the province. Post 1936, when Sind was a separate province, the post of Commissioner in Sind  was renamed as Governor of Sind.",
